<title>FRANCE: Goldman ups Cap Gemini to 'trading buy'.</title>
<headline>Goldman ups Cap Gemini to 'trading buy'.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. brokerage Goldman Sachs has raised its recommendation for computer systems house Cap Gemini to 'trading buy' from 'market performer' and increased its earnings estimate for the French information technology group, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The brokerage declined to comment.</p>
<p>Cap Gemini was up 2.79 percent to 295 francs at 1128 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
